    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "scene meta:"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "location: Earth coastline beach and shallows"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "time: day 7, daytime through sunset"
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "participants: Senareth, Kyreth, Torhh, Olythae, copper-toned Giant, Elyraen, charcoal-grey Giant, Nephoretti assembly"
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "focus: Five Giants engage in non-verbal dialogue with the Nephoretti; Senareth announces plans to introduce spoken sound patterns on day 8 to build the First Tongue."
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "continuity: Follows six days of expanding non-verbal contact; sets up the planned sound/language attempt on day 8"
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "By day seven, five Giants were participating in what had become a kind of wordless dialogue."
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They maintained distance—never approaching within twenty feet of the Nephoretti—but the barrier of terror had cracked.",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Nephoretti",
            "label": "fear",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Curiosity was winning.",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Nephoretti",
            "label": "curiosity",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Senareth stood at the edge of the Nephoretti cluster, watching Kyreth and Torhh work increasingly complex water-patterns while Olythae engaged the copper-toned Giant in sand-shaping exercises.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "shaping",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Elyraen was nearby, observing a charcoal-grey Giant who seemed fascinated by the way Nephoretti bioluminescence intensified in response to emotional states."
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Seven days."
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One breakthrough."
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The beginning of something that might eventually become understanding."
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But Senareth felt the weight of time pressing against their consciousness."
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Five hundred years."
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That's how long the Garden would need to reach its peak."
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Five hundred years of slowly building trust, teaching refined technique, bridging the gap between instinct and art."
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And they had barely managed seven days."
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Patience, came the faint impression through the Prime connection.",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Five",
            "label": "patience",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 44,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Aeon Keepers, offering the only guidance that mattered: Patience, and persistence."
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rome wasn't built in a day."
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 47,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Senareth didn't know what Rome was—the reference existed in knowledge-space they couldn't quite access—but the meaning was clear."
    },
    {
      "line": 48,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Great works took time."
    },
    {
      "line": 49,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gardens didn't bloom overnight."
    },
    {
      "line": 50,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Trust was earned in increments too small to measure until enough accumulated to transform uncertainty into alliance.",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Senareth",
            "label": "uncertainty",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 51,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 52,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "\"Tomorrow,\"",
      "speaker": "Senareth",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.95,
            "source": "pass2_speaker_inference"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 53,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 54,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Around them, bioluminescence flickered with anticipation and trepidation in equal measure.",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Senareth",
            "label": "anticipation",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 55,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They had crossed the first threshold."
    },
    {
      "line": 56,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Now came the real work."
    },
    {
      "line": 57,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 58,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "end of chapter 003-first contact"
    }
  ],
